KAZIM KE GHAM ME MOMIN AANSOO BAHARAHE HAIN.<br>
RANJO ALAM KE BADAL HAR DIL PE CHHARAHE HAIN.<br>
<br>
<br>
1.HAR DIL TADAP RAHA HAI KAZIM KE GHAM MAY DEKHO.<br>
 SADME UTHAKE MOULA DUNIYA SE JARAHE HAI.....<br>
<br>
2.KAISI HAI YE ADAAWAT KTAISI HAI YE SHAQAWAT.<br>
 LAASHE PA BHI MAZALIM JO DHAATE JARAHE HAIN.....<br>
<br>
4.HAI JASR PAR JANAZA KAZIM KA HAAYE GURBAT.<br>
 MOULA KE YE MASAYEB HUMKO RULARAHE HAIN.....<br>
<br>
5.BAGHE JINA KI KHUSHBOO LAASHE SE AARAHI HAI.<br>
 JAATE HUWAY BHI KAZIM KHUSHBOO LUTARAHE HAIN.....<br>
<br>
6.ZEHERE DAGHA SE BABA MARAGAYA HAI MERA.<br>
 ROOTEY HUWAY RAZA YE SABKO SUNA RAHE HAIN.....<br>
<br>
7.MISMAAR KARRAHE HAIN ZAALIM QUBOOR AB BHI.<br>
 ISLAM KE MUHAFIZ SADME UTHARAHE HAIN.....<br>
<br>
8.KYA ZULM O BEBASI KI HADD BHI KOI HAI AAQER.<br>
 QALEEN MAY RAKHKE LAASHA ZAALIM DABAARAHE HAIN.....<br>
 <br>
KAZIM KE GHAM MAY MOMIN AANSOO BAHARAHE HAIN.<br>
